        "subject": "feat(ui): redesign Promotion Explorer cells and checks list (#2218)",
        "body": "Redesign the grid cells. The header shows the state pill, the hydrated\ncommit sha, the pull request link with an icon and a time. Checks are\nlisted in a scrollable list with detail links, SVG status icons and a\n\"N more\" indicator when they overflow. Rows now size to their content.\n\nCell and drawer check links go through a new safeHttpUrl helper that\ndrops non-http(s) urls. Remove the unused healthSummary helper.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jonathan Winters <wintersjonathan0@gmail.com>",
        "sha": "88043a1a47b2ecf84c7a8ace63bfa33a478ad20a",
